return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:29:43+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:29:43+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Waxay ku daabacaysaa boggan luuqad kasta oo aad doorato, cinwaannadeeda gaarka ah ee shabakadda, iyada oo wadata slugs la tarjumay, metadata, menus, alaabada WooCommerce, hreflang, sitemaps luuqad kasta gaar u ah iyo llms.txt. Ku tarjun qorshahaaga Zinn Digital® ama furaahaaga bixiyaha.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la kaydiyay. Geli qiimo cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Kala sifee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Kala shaandhee liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba kalama mid aha shaandhadaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar guud','Overview'=>'Dulmar guud','Copied'=>'Waa la koobiyey','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Xariir kasta oo Zinn® ee ku yaal boggan, iyo haddii uu shaqeynayo.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Xiriir looma baahna furahaan.','Open settings'=>'Fur habaynta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ma haysatid oggolaansho aad ku beddesho goobahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha habaynta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Keydi isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofso habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu celi sidii hore','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay dib ugu celinaysaa dhammaan habaynta plugin-kan sidii hore. Ma doonaysaa inaad sii wadato?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaanka taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo geli faylka habaynta','Import'=>'Soo dhoofso','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay marnaba kuma jiraan furaha sirta ah, calaamadaha (tokens) ama furayaasha API — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad dib ugu geliso goobta cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Hagaajinta waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Xeer kasta oo ku saabsan furankan wuxuu ku noqday kii caadiga ahaa.','Done.'=>'Waa dhammaatay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falkaasi ma heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrin karin. Dooro faylka habaynta ee laga dhoofiyay furin Zinn® ah.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi aad buu u weyn yahay inuu noqdo dhoofinta habaynta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta habaynta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay furin kale (%s), markaa soo dejintiisa halkan waxay kaydinaysaa habayn aysan furintani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Erayada sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan dhoofinta, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Furaha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan wax la dhoofiyay, markaa fadlan mar kale geli kuwaas.','Translate'=>'Turjum','Manual overrides'=>'Bedelaadaha gacanta','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Khariidadaha bogga iyo URL-yada','General'=>'Guud','Who pays for the translation'=>'Yaa bixiya kharashka tarjumaadda','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Hadday ahaan lahayd qorshahaaga Zinn Digital®, ama furahaaga API gaarka ah. Ma jiro heerar bilaash ah — qof ayaa bixiyaha lacag kaga bixiya eray kasta.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Qorshahayga Zinn Digital®','My own provider key'=>'Furaha bixiyahayga','Site ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Goobta','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Ka gal dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®, tab-ka Translation ee boggan.','Site token'=>'Astaanta goobta','An API key from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on its API keys page. Give it the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions.'=>'Furaha API ee laga helo muraayadaada Zinn Digital®, ee boggeeda furayaasha API. Sii rukhsadaha sites.view iyo sites.translation.manage.','Provider'=>'Bixiye','API key'=>'Furaha API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Furahaaga, oo bixiyuhu kugu soo dallacay. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa boggan waxaana loo diraa iyaga kaliya.','Model'=>'Nooc','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'U dhaaf bannaan nooca ugu jaban ee shaqada si fiican u qabta.','This site is written in'=>'Boggan waxaa lagu qoray','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Faaruq uga tag si aad u isticmaasho luqadda goobta ee habaynta WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Luqadaha la daabacayo','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Mid kastaa wuxuu helayaa cinwaanno shabakadeed oo u gaar ah iyo khariidadda goobta oo u gaar ah. Daabac kaliya luuqadaha aad rabto in la tuseyeeyo.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Si toos ah u turjun marka aan daabaco ama cusbooneysiiyo','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Wax ka beddelka boggu wuxuu u calamadeeyaa turjumaannadiisa kuwo duugoobay waxaana dib loogu sameeyaa xagga dambe. Wax ka beddelka iyada oo aan erayo la beddelin waxba ma kiciyo.','What gets translated'=>'Waxa la tarjumo','Post types'=>'Noocyada qoraalka','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Turjun cinwaannada shabakadda sidoo kale','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Soo-booqdayaasha Faransiisku waxay helayaan /fr/a-propos/ halkii ay ka heli lahaayeen /fr/about/. Cinwaanka aan la tarjumin wuxuu sii wadaa shaqada wuxuuna sameeyaa dib-u-hagaajin, sidaas darteed waxba kama jabayaan waxyaabihii la tusmeeyay.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Turjun cinwaannada SEO, sharraxaadaha iyo qoraalka beddelka sawirka','Translate categories and tags'=>'Turjun qaybaha iyo calformatada','Translate navigation menus'=>'Turjun liiska hagidda','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Turjun alaabta iyo sifooyinka WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Sharaxaado kooban, qoraallada iibsiga, calaamadaha sifooyinka iyo sharaxaadda kala duwanaanshaha. Qiimaha, SKUs iyo qiimayaasha xulashada ee la keydiyay waligood lama taabto.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ku dar sumadaha hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Waxay matoorrada raadinta u sheegaysaa in bogaggani ay yihiin isku bog oo ku qoran luuqado kala duwan. Tan daaran u daa ilaa plugin kale uu horey u samaynayo mooyaane.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Daabac khariidadda barta luuqad kasta','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Daabac llms.txt luuqad kasta','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Khariidadda qoraalka cad ee goobta oo ay akhriyaan matoorrada jawaabta AI. Badanaa ma maamuli karaan JavaScript waxaana laga yaabaa inaysan waligood soo qaadin khariidadda goobta.','Language switcher'=>'Beddelaha luuqadda','Style'=>'Qaab','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Midabbada, kala-fogaanshaha iyo geesaha waxay ku yaallaan tabka Qaabeynta. Ku meelee adigoo isticmaalaya baloogga, koodka gaaban ee [zinn_language_switcher], ama meenuu.','Show only these languages'=>'Muuji luqadahan oo keliya','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Faaruq uga tag si aad u muujiso luuqad kasta oo aad ku daabacdo.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Magacow luuqad kasta luuqaddeeda','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd German. Qofka aan akhrin karin boggan hadda ma akhrin karo "German" sidoo kale.','Show flags'=>'Muuji calammada','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'Sida caadiga ah waa dansan yahay: luuqad ma aha waddan, luuqadaha Carabiga iyo Isbaanishkana ma laha hal calan oo aan meesha ka saarayn inta badan dadka ku hadla.','Include the language being read'=>'Ku dar luuqadda la akhrinayo','Include the original language'=>'Ku dar luqadda asalka ah','Add it to this menu'=>'Ku dar liiskan','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Keliya liiska aad halkan ku magacowdo. Waxba laguma daro liis kale oo goobta ku yaal.','Accent'=>'Lahjada','Background'=>'Gadaal','Text'=>'Qoraal','Corner radius'=>'Gacan-geeska','Spacing'=>'Bannaan','Text size'=>'Cabirka qoraalka','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Ha ku darin meel menu ah','none'=>'waxba','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard, under "Shown to visitors". This site checks it every hour. Publishing now: %s.'=>'Qorshaha Zinn Digital® waxaad ku dooranaysaa luqadaha lagu daabacayo tab-ka Turjumaada ee boggan ee ku yaal dashboard-kaaga, qaybta "Shown to visitors". Boggani wuxuu hubiyaa saacad kasta. Hadda daabacaya: %s.','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard. This site has not read that choice yet, so it is still publishing: %s. Check the Site ID and token above.'=>'Qorshaha Zinn Digital®, waxaad ku dooranaysaa luqadaha lagu daabacayo tab-ka Translation ee boggan ee ku yaal koontaroolkaaga. Boggani weli ma akhriyin doorashadaas, sidaas darteed wuxuu weli daabacayaa: %s. Hubi Site ID-ga iyo token-ka kor ku xusan.','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Halkan wax kaga beddel tarjumaad kasta. Tarjumaadda la beddelay waxa loo hayaa sidii aad u qortay mana noqonayso mid lagu dul qoro marka bogga dib loo tarjumo.','Every language'=>'Dhammaan luuqadaha','Search translations'=>'Raadi turjumaadaha','Filter'=>'Kala shaandhee','Content'=>'Xogta','Language'=>'Luqad','Translation'=>'Turjumid','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Save'=>'Kaydi','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Weli waxba lama turjumin. Daabac luqad waxaana turjumaaddu ka bilaaban doontaa dhabarka dambe.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Cinwaanadani waa kuwo toos u shaqaynaya. Fur mid kasta oo iyaga ka mid ah si aad u hubiso, oo u gudbi tusmada khariidadda goobta Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Loma oggola inaad ku beddesho tarjumaadaha boggan.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Waxaa wax ka beddelay adiga — waa la hayay','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Isha waa la beddelay — dib ayaa loo samayn doonaa','Up to date'=>'La cusbooneysiiyay','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Connecting…'=>'Isku xirayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin wax baa u baahan fiiro gaar ah','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Running on your own account'=>'Ku shaqeynta koontadaada gaarka ah','We could not check this'=>'Waan hubin weynay tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Furintaan ma sheegin sababta. Soo dir warbixinta baaritaanka annagaana eegi doona.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xidhiidhka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Markii ugu dambaysay ee la hubiyay waxay ahayd %s kahor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(waxay ku furmaysaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Kani waa dhab ahaan waxa la diri doono — wax kale ma jiro, wax qarsoonna ma jiraan. Furahaaga sirta ah, calaamadaha (tokens), iyo furayaasha API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nuqul ku samee kilib-boodhka','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'U dir warbixintan taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu furaynaa tigidh taageero waxaanan kaga jawaabaynaa iimayl. Haddii aadan doorbidin inaad dirto, kor ka koobiyeey oo adigu geli tigidh.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kuma aan gaari karin Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s). Nuqul ka qaad warbixinta sare oo fur tigidh taa beddelkeeda — waxba kama khaldana habayntaada.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada — tixraaca %s — waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad dirtay dhowr warbixin waqti gaaban gudihiis. Sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way yimaadeen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aqbali karin warbixinta hadda — taasi waa xaggeenna, ma aha xaggaaga. Isku day mar dhow mar kale, ama ku koobiyeey warbixinta sare tikidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Nuqul ka samee xagga sare oo fur tikidh adiga oo tixraacaya lambarkaas.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee loogu talagalay WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, wareejinta bilaashka ah iyo qaybta koontaroolka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi goobaha dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad ay tani shaqadooda tahay','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqayada xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaal, nashqadeeyayaal, sameeyayaal barnaamijyo iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab ku soo gudbiyaan.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'Furaha API waa la diiday. Hubi inuu wali shaqaynayo oo uu leeyahay oggolaanshaha tarjumaadda, ka dibna mar kale kaydi.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Bixiyuhu wuxuu ku diiday qaansheegta ama kootada awgeed. Waxba lama turjumin. Hubi hadhaaga iyo xaddidaadaha koontadaada ee xaggooda.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Bixiyaha tarjumaadda ayaa dhibaato kala kulmaya dhankooda. Waxba lama tarjamin lamana qaadin, waxaana mar kale la isku dayi doonaa wareegga xiga.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Codsiga turjumaaddu wuu fashilmay mana aannu ogaan karin sababta. Waxba lama kaydin.','Sitemap index'=>'Tusmada khariidadda goobta','%s sitemap'=>'Khariidadda bogga %s','LLM content map'=>'Khariidadda nuxurka LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'Khariidadda nuxurka LLM ee %s','Languages published'=>'Luqadaha la daabacay','Site language'=>'Luqadda goobta','SEO plugin'=>'Plugin-ka SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Weli lama habeynin adeeg bixiye turjumid ah.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Geli furaha API ee adeeg-bixiyaha aad dooratay, ama ku xidh bogga akoonka Zinn Digital®, turjumaaduna waxay bilaabmi doontaa wareegga xiga.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'U turjumidda furahaaga %s gaarka ah.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Boggan kuma xidhna koontada Zinn Digital®, taasoo caadi ah — bixiyahaagu wuxuu si toos ah kuugu soo dalacayaa biilka.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Weli kuma xirna Zinn Digital®.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ku dar aqoonsiga (ID) iyo calaamadda (token) boggan laga helo dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®, ama u beddel furahaaga bixiyaha si aad u shaqeyso adigoon koonto lahayn.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ku xiran Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Bixiyaha tarjumaadda waxaa haysta dhibaato.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'Turjumaada waa la hakiyay — bixiyahaagu wuxuu u baahan yahay fiiro gaar ah.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Turjumaadda weli lama habayn.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Wax baa ka qaldamay dhankayaga.','Check their status page'=>'Hubi boggooda xaaladda','Fix this on your account'=>'Ku hagaaji tan koontadaada','Style preset'=>'Hab-dhismeedka hore loo dejiyay','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Barta bilowga. Wax kasta oo ka hooseeya ayaa beddelaya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabadayda iyo cabbirradayda gaarka ah','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Ka tag tan iyadoo dansan oo goobta hore loo sii diyaariyay waxaa loo isticmaali doonaa sida ay tahay.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Beddelaha luuqadda ee Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'U oggolow booqdayaasha inay boggan ku akhriyaan luuqad kale.','Title'=>'Cinwaan','Use the plugin setting'=>'Isticmaal goobta plugin-ka','Dropdown'=>'Liiska hoos-u-dhaca','Inline list'=>'Liiska dhexyaal','Pills'=>'Kiniinno','Minimal text'=>'Qoraalka ugu yar','Flags and names'=>'Calamadaha iyo magacyada','Stacked list'=>'Liis is dul saaran','Choose a language'=>'Dooro luuqad','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraallada warbixinta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ma soo saarin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in goobtani ay gaari karto madal-weynta Zinn®, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta xaqiijinta lamana rakibin.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Lama keydin furaha API-ga DeepL, marka ma jirto wax lagu turjumo.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL uma turjumo %s. U dooro Google Gemini ama OpenAI luuqaddan, ama ku xidh goobta Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin DeepL. Waxba lama tarjumin wax kharash ahna lama qaadin; waxay mar kale isku dayi doontaa wareegga xiga.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'Kootada xarfahaaga DeepL ee muddadan waa la isticmaalay. Turjumaaddu waxay dib u bilaaban doontaa marka dib loo dejiyo, ama marka aad kordhiso xadka koontadaada DeepL.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL wuxuu kaga jawaabay wax aynaan akhrin karin. Waxba lama keydin.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Lama keydin furaha Google Gemini API, markaa ma jiraan wax lagu tarjumo.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Google Gemini. Waxba lama tarjumin wax kharash ahna lama qaadin; markale ayaa la isku dayi doonaa wareegga xiga.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Lama keydin furaha OpenAI API, sidaas darteed waxba laguma turjumi karo.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin OpenAI. Waxba lama turjumin wax lacag ahna lama qaadin; markale ayaa la isku dayi doona wareegga xiga.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Boggan kuma xidhna Zinn Digital®, markaa ma jiraan wax la ururiyo. Ku dar Aqoonsiga Goobta iyo calaamadda (token), ama u beddel furahaaga bixiyaha.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Boggan kuma xiriir lama laha Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Zinn Digital®. Waxba lama dirin; waxay isku dayi doontaa mar kale wareegga xiga.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Turjumaada waa la hakiyay goobtan. Ka hubi dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital® in koontadu ay tahay mid la cusbooneysiiyay.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. It must be an API key with the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions — create one on the API keys page of your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® wuu diiday sumadda (token) goobtan. Waa inay ahaataa furaha API oo leh oggolaanshaha sites.view iyo sites.translation.manage — mid ka samee bogga furayaasha API ee dashboard-kaaga.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Zinn Digital®. Bartu waxay sii waddaa bixinta tarjumadihii ay hore u haysatay.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® wuxuu ku soo jawaabay wax aanan akhrin karin. Boggaagu wuxuu sii wadayaa bixinta tarjumaadaha uu hadda haysto.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Zinn Digital®. Boggaaga wuxuu sii wadaa daabacaadda luuqadaha uu horey u lahaa.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® wuxuu kaga jawaabay wax aynaan akhriyi karin. Boggaagu wuxuu sii wadaa daabacaadda luuqadaha uu hadda haysto.']];